101
00:10:31,083 --> 00:10:32,791
Seguro que Barb te contó.

102
00:10:35,583 --> 00:10:36,833
No.

103
00:10:36,916 --> 00:10:38,166
Les digo "amigos de Bud".

104
00:10:38,250 --> 00:10:40,708
La idea es que el mayor obstáculo

105
